      "created_at": "2015-03-19T20:51:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was looking at Richard Launius' LinkedIn profile and he mentions something strange under his game company's section.</p><blockquote><p><span>Several new designs are in process, including: Alien Uprising, Mythos Tales, Master Villains Super Spies and Schemes of Mass Destruction, Swashbucklers Soldiers and Scoundrels, Chronos Wars, <strong>Freedom Five and Mayhem in Megalopolis</strong>. Also new expansions for Elder Sign and Defenders of the Realm are in development.</span></p></blockquote><p>What is Freedom Five and Mayhem in Megalopolis? Is that something we have already seen or something to come?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:18.389Z",
