      "raw": "<p>I was looking at Richard Launius&#39; LinkedIn profile and he mentions something strange under his game company&#39;s section.</p><blockquote><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 17px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Several new designs are in process, including: Alien Uprising, Mythos Tales, Master Villains Super Spies and Schemes of Mass Destruction, Swashbucklers Soldiers and Scoundrels, Chronos Wars, <strong>Freedom Five and Mayhem in Megalopolis</strong>. Also new expansions for Elder Sign and Defenders of the Realm are in development.</span></p></blockquote><p>What is Freedom Five and Mayhem in Megalopolis? Is that something we have already seen or something to come?</p>",
